  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>langextract_contracts - extracts seven key terms from each contract with the LangExtract service, loads one
row per clause and one wide row per contract.
Needs: the LangExtract service on http://localhost:8765 (qwen2.5:7b) and the three staging tables in the
pgvector kit's genai database.

1. gfn-contracts: Get file names, ${Internal.Entry.Current.Directory}/../contracts, Regular Expression .*\.txt.
2. load-contracts: Load file content in memory, filename from the field filename, UTF-8, the whole file into
   contract_text.
3. js-request: Modified JavaScript value: contract_id from short_filename less .txt; request_json with the
   contract, the prompt, one worked example with the seven classes, model_id ${LX_MODEL},
   max_char_buffer 1500, overlap 200, extraction_passes 2.
4. rest-extract: REST client, POST http://localhost:8765/extract, body request_json, result response_json.
5. json-clauses: JSON input on response_json: class, text (String), start, end (Integer) from $.extractions[*].
6. flt-grounded: Filter rows start IS NOT NULL; TRUE to sys-extracted-at, ungrounded values dropped.
7. sys-extracted-at: Get system info, extracted_at = system date (variable); copies every row to both
   branches.
8. tbl-clause-details: Table output on genai, staging.clause_details: contract_id, class, text, start, end,
   extracted_at.
9. sv-pivot: Select values keeps contract_id, class, text, extracted_at.
10. dnorm-contracts: Row denormaliser, key class, group contract_id: party_a, party_b, effective_date,
    termination, payment_terms, liability_cap, governing_law.
11. js-validate: Modified JavaScript value, validation_status Y when party_a, party_b, effective_date and
    governing_law are set, else N.
12. flt-valid: Filter rows validation_status = Y; TRUE to tbl-contract-master, FALSE to tbl-review-queue.
13. tbl-contract-master, tbl-review-queue: Table output on genai, staging.contract_master and
    staging.contract_review_queue, the wide row.

Parameters: LX_MODEL qwen2.5:7b; PG_HOST localhost, PG_PORT 5433, PG_DATABASE genai, PG_USER
genai, PG_PASSWORD genai.
Shipped data: 3 contracts; on the course PC 22 to 23 grounded clauses of 36, contract-001 and
contract-002 in contract_master, contract-003 in the review queue.</note>
      <xloc>160</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>630</width>
      <heigth>566</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
